      <p begin="01:34.980" end="01:39.490" ttm:agent="v1">Make me lose my breath, make me water</p>
      <p begin="01:39.490" end="01:41.350" ttm:agent="v1">Hopefully</p>
      <p begin="01:41.350" end="01:46.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You can last all night, don't get too excited (ooh)</p>
      <p begin="01:46.340" end="01:49.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Oh, privacy (mm)</p>
      <p begin="01:49.340" end="01:53.540" ttm:agent="v1">You ain't gotta go nowhere, you can stay inside it</p>
      <p begin="01:53.540" end="01:57.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Can you blow my mind? (Oh)</p>
